---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
---
<Layout title="Volunteering">
  <Nav />
  <main>
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-mono text-sm text-muted">Volunteering</h2>
      <article class="mt-6 border-t border-panel py-8">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-1">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-paper">
            Piece of My Heart Volume 6 — Együttható
          </h3>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-muted">13 Oct 2024 – 28 Aug 2025</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">
          European Solidarity Corps · Budapest, Hungary
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-paper/90">
          Supported young people with disabilities, autistic people, and Roma
          people by helping them take part in inclusive activities and providing personal
          assistance in the building and during prearranged outdoor activities.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-paper/90">
          Also assisted with workshops and other Community House events designed to encourage
          participation, engagement, and socialization. For instance, I organized events dedicated to web accessibility, digital literacy and technnology, also I held intercultural nights and English speaking club sessions. Me and other volunteers participated in institution and school visits, promoting social awareness and personal development.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-paper/90">
        Developed the official website for the "Break the Glass Ceiling" international project that brought together 5 partner countries to empower young women. The goal of the project was to research access to employment and education among extra-EU women specifically.  
        <a
            href="https://www.womenvolunteers.eu/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="text-paper underline decoration-panel underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-accent ml-4"
          >
            Project website ↗
          </a>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-paper/90">
        The experience introduced me to different approaches to inclusion, non-formal education community participation and everyday support, reinforcing my interest in making social and digital environments more accessible. This cultural exchange between volunteers and disabled people taught me a lot about teamwork, empathy, responsibility and adaptation.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 font-mono text-xs">
          <a
            href="https://egyutthato.eu/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="text-paper underline decoration-panel underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-accent"
          >
            Együttható website ↗
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://www.facebook.com/EgyuttHato"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="text-paper underline decoration-panel underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-accent"
          >
            Facebook ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

<article class="mt-6 border-t border-panel py-8">
 <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-1">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-paper">
            Roma Remembrance and Solidarity Seminar — Amaro Drom e.V.
          </h3>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-muted">10 Dec 2024 – 15 Dec 2024</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">
          European Solidarity Corps · Berlin, Germany
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-paper/90">
          Participated in the project which aimed to develop a comprehensive approach on Genocide remembrance and education of marginalised youth while combatting racism in Europe.
        </p>
        </article>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>